<title>CHINA: ARTFIELD YEAR NET PROFIT UP 20 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ARTFIELD YEAR NET PROFIT UP 20 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	16.05  vs 13.79</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 3.5    vs 4.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 36.61  vs 30.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		  263.09 vs 247.81</p>
<p>    Company name	    Artfield Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     September 15-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	October 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Artfield Group is a clock maker.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 8.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of five cents) vs nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
